    {
      "id": "u_3d7cefb4ab51c893930477cc_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "PikaPods generally updates their Trilium instances to the latest version within a two-week interval after a new version is released.",
      "sourceHash": "3d7cefb4ab51c893930477cc0dae52f83f8492b0bea6bb70de4e1aaf529899d3",
      "context": "Third-party cloud hosting > Cloud instance providers > PikaPods",
      "contextHash": "5032d864fb626b9c368031509fd51ff4903eed5a8fc052df829adcd416311452",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "PikaPodsは通常、新しいバージョンのリリース後、2週間以内にTriliumインスタンスを最新バージョンにアップデートします。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T16:50:34.717Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_bdeb5e9b10fff63a66f746a0_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Matching your version with the cloud instance__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "bdeb5e9b10fff63a66f746a08f8d4e13923f4083b3d159ab49bba009ef3aad7d",
      "context": "Third-party cloud hosting > Matching your version with the cloud instance",
      "contextHash": "fc562d90a46ebcf47cc5400f3053d7080664b44e55522c631bc4d4cb33296b87",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "クラウドインスタンスとバージョンの同期__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T16:50:34.717Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_1e0a054aecea7b9ce62b79bc_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Please note that once you set up __TRILIUM_PH_0__Synchronization__TRILIUM_PH_1__ between a cloud instance and __TRILIUM_PH_2__desktop__TRILIUM_PH_3__ clients, it's important that the version of the desktop application and the server match up.",
      "sourceHash": "1e0a054aecea7b9ce62b79bc7a6ebdf727036cfb110fa8bec6e7a1c393109128",
      "context": "Third-party cloud hosting > Matching your version with the cloud instance",
      "contextHash": "fc562d90a46ebcf47cc5400f3053d7080664b44e55522c631bc4d4cb33296b87",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_2a4b4bbc6d987ea57bee9b5f_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "When setting up a cloud instance, it's best to check the version of the server by accessing it via a web browser and going to the __TRILIUM_PH_0__About__TRILIUM_PH_1__ section. It's best that both the desktop and the server have the same __TRILIUM_PH_2__App version__TRILIUM_PH_3__; however it's generally OK to update the desktop to a newer version than the server if it has the same __TRILIUM_PH_4__Sync version__TRILIUM_PH_5__.",
      "sourceHash": "2a4b4bbc6d987ea57bee9b5f69576d31a6d9147bb335b1e11d88c3f96b128385",
      "context": "Third-party cloud hosting > Matching your version with the cloud instance",
      "contextHash": "fc562d90a46ebcf47cc5400f3053d7080664b44e55522c631bc4d4cb33296b87",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "クラウドインスタンスを設定する際は、ウェブブラウザからアクセスして__TRILIUM_PH_0__About__TRILIUM_PH_1__セクションを確認し、サーバーのバージョンを確認することをお勧めします。デスクトップとサーバーの__TRILIUM_PH_2__App version__TRILIUM_PH_3__は同じであることが望ましいですが、__TRILIUM_PH_4__Sync version__TRILIUM_PH_5__が同じであれば、サーバーよりも新しいバージョンにデスクトップをアップデートすることは概ね問題ありません。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T16:50:34.717Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_49eed2155ca0ddef156342b4_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "If the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Sync version__TRILIUM_PH_1__ between the server and the desktop application doesn't match, synchronization will not work.",
      "sourceHash": "49eed2155ca0ddef156342b49b12de386c2da5079bd6397816f4f2340959a265",
      "context": "Third-party cloud hosting > Matching your version with the cloud instance",
      "contextHash": "fc562d90a46ebcf47cc5400f3053d7080664b44e55522c631bc4d4cb33296b87",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "サーバーとデスクトップアプリケーションの間で__TRILIUM_PH_0__Sync version__TRILIUM_PH_1__が一致しない場合、同期は機能しません。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T16:50:34.717Z"
